        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant L as Listener\n    participant I as Icecast\n    participant B as Backend&lt;br/&gt;Go\n    participant O as Ollama&lt;br/&gt;AI Agents\n    participant T as Chatterbox&lt;br/&gt;TTS\n    participant Lq as Liquidsoap\n    participant DB as SQLite\n    \n    L-&gt;&gt;I: Stream Playing Song\n    I--&gt;&gt;L: MP3 Audio\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Wait 45s before end\n    B-&gt;&gt;DB: getCandidates()\n    DB--&gt;&gt;B: Similar Songs List\n    B-&gt;&gt;O: Director Prompt\n    Note over O: Pick next song&lt;br/&gt;based on BPM/mood\n    O--&gt;&gt;B: Selected Track Path\n    B-&gt;&gt;O: DJ Prompt\n    Note over O: Write intro text&lt;br/&gt;for next song\n    O--&gt;&gt;B: DJ Voiceover Text\n    B-&gt;&gt;T: generateVoice()\n    Note over T: Synthesize WAV&lt;br/&gt;with TTS\n    T--&gt;&gt;B: WAV File\n    B-&gt;&gt;Lq: QUEUE next_song.mp3\n    B-&gt;&gt;Lq: PLAY duke_voice.wav\n    Lq-&gt;&gt;Lq: Duck music&lt;br/&gt;Play voice&lt;br/&gt;Crossfade to next\n    Lq--&gt;&gt;I: Continuous Stream\n    I--&gt;&gt;L: Seamless Transition\n    B-&gt;&gt;DB: logPlayHistory()&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="4_oQpKTtZL_Va0riHtkI-1">
